share.whatsappText:
Hi! {{owner}} shared their photos and videos with you on MyMedia (view only).

1. Open {{link}}
2. Sign in with your Google account {{email}}
3. Open the ☰ menu, then 👁 View, and choose "MyMedia of {{owner}}".

To have it as an app: ☰ menu → "Install the app".

cleanup.blurHelp:
The sharpness score: the lower it is, the more blurred the photo.
• below about 30: very blurred;
• 30 to 80: blurred or a little blurred;
• above 100: usually sharp.
MyMedia cuts the thumbnail into 16 areas and keeps the score of the sharpest one: a sharp bird on a blurred background scores well. A plain sky, fog or a very small, distant bird can score low without being blurred.
The Severity slider sets the limit: to the left, only the most blurred; to the right, more photos.
